+## 7. Open questions
+
+- **Markdown parsing library or regex?** Recommendation: **`markdown-it-py`** — established Python markdown parser, minimal deps, AST-based. Decision before Phase 1 implementation starts.
+- **`commit_hash` for card footer — explicit param vs auto-derive?** Recommendation: **auto-derive via `git log` heuristic** (find commit closest to `shipped_at`) with explicit override. Most agents won't know the hash off-hand.
+- **What if a phase has 0 learnings logged?** Recommendation: **breadcrumb anyway, marked "0 cards · phase missed enrichment loop"** — visible failure, makes the slip discoverable. Don't refuse the operation.
+- **Should breadcrumb keep the phase's status icon?** Recommendation: **yes** — `### Phase N — <title> ✅ → archive.md §N · K cards · commit <hash>`. Status is part of the breadcrumb's information.
+
